cial they've waited for this day for  since they were like three four years  old  so the most important day of their life  is this day  [Music]  yeah a bride celebrates not just her  wedding  her outfit but the entire process of  this journey her own way  there's a lot of emotional pressure a  lot of societal pressure of  what the right thing to do is the idea  is to you do it your way and just  celebrate it  you

